🚀  Executive Summary
The big picture — what QuizNova is and why it will win

QuizNova is an AI-powered, gamified quiz platform purpose-built for India's 300M+ student and aspirant market. It transforms rote, passive learning into an addictive daily habit by combining adaptive difficulty, instant AI explanations, real-time competition, and rich gamification — delivered in both Hindi and English.
🎯 Vision:  Make learning as addictive as scrolling — one quiz at a time.
🧭 Mission:  Help every Indian student learn faster, retain more, and stay motivated through data-driven, personalised micro-learning.
📍 Market:  India-first (Bharat + metros), Hindi + English, mobile-only.

Why Now?
Three tailwinds have created a once-in-a-decade opening:
	•	India has 900M+ smartphone users; cheap data has put learning apps within reach of Tier-2/3 cities.
	•	Existing apps (Unacademy, BYJU's) are expensive, heavy, and built for passive consumption — not habit formation.
	•	GPT-class AI now makes personalised tutoring economically viable at scale for the first time.

