🎯  Goals & Success Metrics
How we define and measure success

Primary Goals
	•	Drive daily active usage through habit-forming features (streaks, daily quiz).
	•	Achieve measurable improvement in learning retention (spaced repetition, mistake review).
	•	Build a sustainable monetisation funnel targeting 3–5% paid conversion.
	•	Become the #1 quiz app for Indian students within 18 months of launch.

